    thinking: "**Initiating Project Development**\n\nI\'m now starting development on the interactive DICOM slice generator and canvas renderer, focusing on `src/components/viewer/DicomCanvas.tsx`. Currently, I\'m identifying key anatomical renderers to include, with the first two being `brain_skull_base` and `brain_posterior`. I need to figure out the best way to integrate these renderers.\n\n\n**Expanding Anatomical Coverage**\n\nI\'ve expanded the list of anatomical renderers significantly, adding structures like `fossa`, `brain_midbrain_temporal`, and several bone and knee structures. I\'m also now thinking about adding chest X-ray and mammography views. I\'ve also drafted requirements for the viewer canvas, which include zoom and pan functionality, window level adjustments, and color map selection. Measurement tools will be added later.\n\n\n"
