    thinking: "**Analyzing Design Specs**\n\nI\'m currently diving into the \"Elegant Dark\" design theme. I\'m focusing on the color palette, specifically the base background (`bg-neutral-950`) and text color (`text-neutral-200`). My goal is to determine how best to implement these within the imaging and DICOM management application.\n\n\n**Refining Color and Style**\n\nI\'ve been drilling down on specific components. Considering `text-neutral-400`, `text-neutral-500`, and white for headings. For cards and panels, I\'m exploring variations of `bg-neutral-900`. I\'m leaning toward subtle blue accents (`blue-500` to `blue-600`) with a glow effect. I\'m also considering styling for badges, inputs, buttons (primary and secondary), and how the brand should look and feel. Sidebar and header layout are underway with a focus on navigation and dividers.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 677379163
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
