  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Notifications & Portal**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on building the notification and patient portal components. I\'m starting by identifying the specific components needed, starting with `NotificationSettingsModal.tsx`. I will be creating a tab for \"Reglas de Antelaci\303\263n y Canales\" to configure the early notification rules and channels.\n\n\n**Designing Notification Rules**\n\nNow, I\'m diving deep into the notification rule configuration. I\'m visualizing a tab dedicated to \"Reglas de Antelaci\303\263n y Canales,\" enabling the configuration of early notification rules via time selectors (48h, 24h, custom rules with hours/days) and channel toggles (Email, SMS, WhatsApp). The next step is a focus on modal templates and their interactive delivery simulations.\n\n\n**Developing Patient Portal Features**\n\nI\'m now implementing the `NotificationCenterDrawer.tsx`, a side drawer linked to the notification bell, displaying recent alerts, automated send status, and quick access to settings. Concurrently, I\'m working on the `PatientPortal.tsx` and its components, particularly `PatientPortalLogin.tsx` with its DNI/PIN form, demo patient access, and security indicator. Additionally, I\'m designing the patient portal navbar and the studies view with an interactive image viewer.\n\n\n**Implementing Portal Features**\n\nI am now focusing on the patient portal appointments features, designing the \"Descargar / Imprimir Informe\" button which opens a view for saving or printing PDFs. I also have the \"Explicaci\303\263n para el Paciente (IA)\" button, translating complex reports to plain language. I am building `PatientPortalAppointments.tsx`, including appointment cards with countdowns and preparation indicators, and the patient\'s appointment history. Additionally, the new `PatientPortalRequestAppointment.tsx` is being worked on, which will allow patients to request new appointments with study/modality selection, date/time preference, clinical reason input, medical order uploads, and a security questionnaire.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 23
      nanos: 60093791
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
